## Phase 8 Gate: Validation & Testing

| Condition | Verifiable Evidence |
|-----------|---------------------|
| Unit tests passing | `ctest --output-on-failure` reports 0 failures |
| pluginval validation passing | pluginval reports 0 errors |
| Audio thread safety audit passing | No allocations, no locks in processBlock |
| Gain staging verified | Effect audible at all parameter ranges |

**Blocker Examples:**
- Tests failing → Fix bugs before proceeding
- pluginval errors → Fix validation issues
- Effect not audible → Audit gain staging

---

## Phase 9 Gate: DAW Testing

| Condition | Verifiable Evidence |
|-----------|---------------------|
| Plugin loads in REAPER | Human confirms plugin appears and loads |
| Basic functionality works | Human confirms audio processing correctly |
| Parameter ranges work | Human confirms all parameters function without clicks |
| Presets load/save | Human confirms preset system works |
| No perceptual issues | Human confirms no clicks, pops, dropouts, distortion |

**Blocker Examples:**
- Plugin crashes → Debug and fix
- Clicks/pops → Fix parameter smoothing or buffer handling
- Distortion → Fix gain staging or algorithm

